00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:28.160
As rose petals do.

00:23:28.270 --> 00:23:29.390
Was that a joke?

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:31.740
My! You were able to play the straight-man!

00:23:31.740 --> 00:23:32.440
That was splendid, Yumi!

